  "description": "<p>There appears to be a missing console attribute in the error handling routine at line 56 in resources.py.</p>\n\n<p>Traceback (most recent call last):<br/>\nFile \"/Library/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.6/lib/python3.6/site-packages/fcrepo_verify/verifier.py\", line 135, in execute<br/>\noriginal.filter_binary_refs()<br/>\nFile \"/Library/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.6/lib/python3.6/site-packages/fcrepo_verify/resources.py\", line 98, in filter_binary_refs<br/>\nFedoraResource(o, self.config, self.logger).is_binary():<br/>\nFile \"/Library/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.6/lib/python3.6/site-packages/fcrepo_verify/resources.py\", line 56, in init<br/>\nself.console.error(\"Unexpected response from Fedora\")<br/>\nAttributeError: 'FedoraResource' object has no attribute 'console'</p>\n",
